  "question": {
    "text": "<p>But-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>-yne is reacted separately with one mole of Hydrogen as shown below:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></munder><munderover><mo>&#8592;</mo><mrow><mi>liq</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mi>Na</mi></munderover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mrow><mi>Pd</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></munderover><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></munder></math></p><p>Identify the incorrect statements from the options given below:</p><p>A. A is more soluble than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>.<br />B. The boiling point &amp; melting point of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>are higher and lower than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> respectively.</p><p>C. A is more polar than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> because dipole moment of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is zero.<br />D. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;adds easily to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "B and C only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "B, C and D only",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "A, C and D only",
